Q3. Write a query to find the name (first_name, last_name), job, department ID and name of the employees who works in London.
SELECT e.first_name, e.last_name, e.job_id, e.department_id, d.department_nameFROM employees eJOIN departments dON e.department_id = d.department_id
JOIN locations l
ON d.location_id = l.location_id
WHERE l.city = 'London';
